## [MyFinanceTracker Secrets & Configuration]

# 1. Google API Credentials (CRITICAL)
# Excludes the JSON key file anywhere in the solution
**/google-api-credentials.json
**/google-credentials.json

# 2. Application Settings
# We ignore real configs. Use appsettings.Example.json for the repository.
**/appsettings.json
**/appsettings.Development.json
**/appsettings.Local.json

# 3. Domain/Business Data
# If your category mapping contains private info
categories.yaml

# 4. Docker & Environment
.env
*.local.env

# 5. Publishing artifacts
publish/
out/